WEBVTT

01:18.800 --> 01:21.000
As the ancients said,
"A fleeting romance should be avoided."

01:22.280 --> 01:23.480
Indeed.

01:24.760 --> 01:26.120
It's more fragile than paper.

01:37.720 --> 01:38.560
Zhuang Jie,

01:40.720 --> 01:41.760
I'm new to this.

01:42.560 --> 01:44.040
I'm no match for you.

01:48.600 --> 01:49.800
So…

01:53.120 --> 01:54.040
Let's forget about it.

03:26.680 --> 03:31.480
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

03:46.760 --> 03:47.600
Grandma.

03:47.680 --> 03:50.200
Remember to unplug the charger
once it's fully charged.

03:50.280 --> 03:52.320
I've also placed a box of nuts
under your bed.

03:53.320 --> 03:54.200
Got it.

03:54.280 --> 03:56.520
I have a gathering tonight.
I won't be back for dinner.

03:56.600 --> 03:58.400
Order something nice from that food court.

03:58.480 --> 03:59.760
Don't eat leftovers.

03:59.840 --> 04:02.080
I hear you. Now go.

04:03.400 --> 04:04.760
How naggy can you be?

04:06.960 --> 04:07.800
Who's there?

04:11.240 --> 04:14.080
Mrs. Chen, it's me.

04:14.160 --> 04:15.600
Why didn't you come inside?

04:15.680 --> 04:16.720
You scared me.

04:17.519 --> 04:20.200
Mrs. Chen, I brought you
some local produce.

04:21.720 --> 04:23.240
There is shredded beef jerky,

04:24.080 --> 04:25.200
cold rice cakes,

04:26.080 --> 04:27.560
and shelled peanuts.

04:28.800 --> 04:30.840
These peanut candies are delicious.

04:30.920 --> 04:32.040
They're all snacks.

04:32.120 --> 04:34.120
Be careful not to let them
ruin your appetite.

04:34.880 --> 04:36.520
Maidong said you were working.

04:36.600 --> 04:38.320
He didn't even tell me where you went.

04:39.280 --> 04:40.480
Look at you.

04:40.560 --> 04:43.680
You still buy so many things for me
despite your busy schedule.

04:43.760 --> 04:45.240
Mrs. Chen, no need to play host.

04:45.320 --> 04:47.480
I'm going to go after dropping this off.

04:48.720 --> 04:52.560
Apart from telling you that I was working,

04:53.080 --> 04:54.640
did Chen Maidong tell you anything else?

04:55.320 --> 04:56.320
No.

04:56.400 --> 04:58.920
He said you're quite busy lately

04:59.000 --> 05:00.240
and didn't have time to see me.

05:00.800 --> 05:02.200
-Here.
-Thanks.

05:02.680 --> 05:03.600
Mrs. Chen.

05:04.520 --> 05:06.320
Don't sit too close. I have a cold.

05:07.560 --> 05:10.880
No wonder your face looks so skinny.

05:11.640 --> 05:14.200
I think you've worked too hard.

05:14.280 --> 05:16.120
Why are you still working
on New Year's Day?

05:16.200 --> 05:17.680
You must be exhausted.

05:18.520 --> 05:19.400
All right.

05:19.480 --> 05:21.760
Mrs. Chen, I really have to go now.

05:21.840 --> 05:23.000
I don't want to infect you.

05:23.080 --> 05:24.840
I'll let you clean this up.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.560
-I'll visit again when I'm better.
-Okay.

05:26.640 --> 05:27.760
Get some rest.

05:27.840 --> 05:28.720
Bye.

05:32.080 --> 05:34.240
One is unbearably naggy

05:34.320 --> 05:36.440
and the other one
always has someplace to be.

05:37.520 --> 05:39.480
How I wish they could
balance each other out.

05:42.400 --> 05:43.360
Since last year,

05:43.440 --> 05:45.760
I've been looking forward
to our annual class reunion.

05:45.840 --> 05:47.560
And we have a special guest today.

05:47.640 --> 05:49.360
It's her first time joining us.

05:49.440 --> 05:51.200
Really? I can't wait to find out.

05:51.280 --> 05:53.080
Don't rush. Someone is not here yet.

05:53.160 --> 05:54.440
There she is.

05:54.520 --> 05:55.400
Hey, there.

05:55.480 --> 05:58.320
Showing up late just like a superstar.

05:58.400 --> 06:00.480
Zhuang Jie, you've completely transformed.

06:00.560 --> 06:02.920
Exactly. I couldn't recognize her
on the streets.

06:03.000 --> 06:04.800
Don't exaggerate.
You all look pretty good too.

06:04.880 --> 06:06.240
Look at your radiant faces.

06:06.960 --> 06:07.920
Why don't you sit here?

06:09.240 --> 06:11.760
I would rather not. I have a cold.

06:11.840 --> 06:13.560
-Let's not infect Chen Maidong.
-Sit with me.

06:13.640 --> 06:15.520
Then won't you infect me?

06:15.600 --> 06:17.080
Come on, you're healthy.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.560
Stop flattering yourself.

06:18.640 --> 06:20.720
Do you think Zhuang Jie is targeting you?

06:20.800 --> 06:22.440
She's targeting Li Pei.

06:22.520 --> 06:23.680
They're both business elites,

06:23.760 --> 06:24.760
handsome and beautiful.

06:24.840 --> 06:25.920
Perhaps, they could even

06:26.000 --> 06:28.000
spark an interesting conversation
among themselves.

06:28.480 --> 06:30.360
If I remember correctly,
you must be Liang Wei.

06:30.440 --> 06:32.160
You used to love
butting in on conversations.

06:32.240 --> 06:33.920
Unsurprisingly,
you haven't changed at all.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.560
I'm so sorry, guys.

06:38.640 --> 06:40.720
I can't drink alcohol,
so I'll substitute it with tea.

06:40.800 --> 06:41.800
Here's a toast. Come on.

06:41.880 --> 06:43.120
-Come on, guys.
-Cheers.

06:43.200 --> 06:44.200
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

06:46.720 --> 06:48.040
It has been so long.

06:53.040 --> 06:54.240
-Let's eat.
-Let's eat.

06:54.320 --> 06:55.800
-Come on, let's eat.
-Dig in.

06:57.360 --> 06:58.520
You know me.

06:58.600 --> 07:00.320
We've been drinking for three rounds.

07:00.400 --> 07:02.560
Remember, we must drink
until we are thoroughly drunk.

07:02.640 --> 07:03.520
Li Pei.

07:03.600 --> 07:06.080
The refinancing optimization policy
will soon be implemented.

07:06.720 --> 07:07.800
The regulatory arrangements

07:07.880 --> 07:10.080
that were implemented last year

07:10.560 --> 07:12.080
saw a direct polarization

07:12.160 --> 07:13.920
between blue chip stocks and junk stocks.

07:14.000 --> 07:15.680
As soon as this policy was launched,

07:15.760 --> 07:18.400
the number of backdoor listings
started to decrease.

07:18.480 --> 07:20.320
Don't you think that it's senseless?

07:20.400 --> 07:22.440
Different trades are worlds apart.
I've learned a lot.

07:23.360 --> 07:24.960
They're whispering to each other again.

07:26.080 --> 07:28.800
Like I said just now,
whenever they get together,

07:28.880 --> 07:30.560
things will surely get interesting.

07:30.640 --> 07:32.520
Liang, enough of that nonsense.

07:32.600 --> 07:33.520
Let's drink.

07:34.080 --> 07:36.320
Why don't you ask Chen Maidong
to drink with you instead?

07:36.400 --> 07:38.240
He hasn't even
taken a sip yet. Why is that?

07:38.320 --> 07:41.000
I can't drink with you
due to my profession.

07:41.760 --> 07:43.440
Speaking of your profession,

07:44.960 --> 07:47.000
I'm here today to tell you this.

07:47.080 --> 07:49.640
Your dad's company
is currently our biggest supplier.

07:51.040 --> 07:54.240
Indeed, his dad
runs a huge and successful business.

07:54.800 --> 07:57.320
I'm so envious of you
for having a good father.

07:59.400 --> 08:00.320
Here.

08:01.320 --> 08:02.560
I really can't.

08:02.640 --> 08:05.240
However, you insist
on being stubborn with him,

08:06.240 --> 08:08.720
forgoing your family's fortune

08:08.800 --> 08:10.320
by not inheriting your dad's business.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.760
Everyone has their own ambition.

08:13.520 --> 08:15.120
What is your ambition?

08:15.200 --> 08:17.720
All I know is poverty stunts ambition.

08:17.800 --> 08:18.720
That's you.

08:19.640 --> 08:22.000
Chen Maidong, listen to my advice.

08:22.080 --> 08:23.280
Stop working with dead people.

08:23.360 --> 08:25.120
There's no future in it.

08:25.200 --> 08:26.840
Liang Wei,
shut your mouth if you're drunk.

08:26.920 --> 08:28.600
Keep quiet when a man is speaking.

08:28.680 --> 08:29.880
Liang.

08:30.560 --> 08:32.840
I've had enough of this conversation.
Enough is enough.

08:32.919 --> 08:33.960
Am I wrong?

08:34.039 --> 08:35.480
She clearly lacks discipline.

08:35.559 --> 08:37.280
I don't need her to teach me what to say.

08:39.320 --> 08:40.919
Do you need me to teach you?

08:48.800 --> 08:50.120
Come on, teach me.

08:51.440 --> 08:52.760
Show me.

08:52.840 --> 08:54.200
Let me see what you can do!

08:54.280 --> 08:55.520
Come on!

08:55.600 --> 08:56.680
Enough!

08:56.760 --> 08:57.840
-Stop.
-Liang, you're drunk.

08:57.920 --> 08:58.960
-Sit down.
-Waiter.

08:59.040 --> 09:00.800
Bring some peanuts to help him sober up.

09:08.480 --> 09:09.640
-Maidong.
-Maidong.

09:10.400 --> 09:11.280
Maidong!

09:27.200 --> 09:28.120
Chen Maidong!

09:28.640 --> 09:29.800
Wait for me, Chen Maidong.

09:30.400 --> 09:31.440
Wait up.

09:32.000 --> 09:33.320
Chen Maidong, I was wrong.

09:33.400 --> 09:34.800
I was so wrong.

09:34.880 --> 09:35.920
Please forgive me.

09:37.480 --> 09:39.560
I'm sorry.

09:39.640 --> 09:40.880
I said hurtful things that day.

09:40.960 --> 09:42.720
I shouldn't have said those words.

09:42.800 --> 09:44.280
I shouldn't have said that about you.

09:44.360 --> 09:46.640
Chen Maidong,
can you forgive me like a gentleman?

09:49.200 --> 09:50.720
There were many gentlemen back there.

09:51.280 --> 09:53.680
Go back. Don't follow me. I'm a gangster.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.920
You're finally giving me attention.

09:59.600 --> 10:00.840
Get angry at me all you want,

10:00.920 --> 10:02.520
but don't give me the silent treatment.

10:03.880 --> 10:05.160
Stop walking away.

10:05.240 --> 10:06.240
My leg is tired.

10:06.760 --> 10:08.200
I didn't ask you to follow me.

10:09.080 --> 10:10.280
But I want to follow you.

10:13.880 --> 10:16.360
I'm already groveling,

10:17.000 --> 10:18.840
so stop punishing me

10:18.920 --> 10:20.680
and give me an out.

10:23.600 --> 10:25.840
If you didn't want to do it,
you could have told me nicely.

10:26.960 --> 10:28.680
Why slander me with those words?

10:30.040 --> 10:31.200
I'm human too.

10:31.280 --> 10:32.400
I have dignity too.

10:35.160 --> 10:36.320
I'm really sorry.

10:38.720 --> 10:40.240
What will it take to appease you?

10:41.360 --> 10:42.280
I can kneel.

10:44.080 --> 10:45.560
Or you can slap me in the face.

10:45.640 --> 10:47.160
Go on, slap me.

10:47.720 --> 10:49.120
Stop it, Zhuang Jie.

10:49.200 --> 10:50.680
Seeing you annoys me now.

10:56.840 --> 10:57.800
What do you mean?

10:59.560 --> 11:00.760
Can you say that again?

11:04.600 --> 11:06.160
Go on, say that again.

11:08.880 --> 11:09.800
I said you're annoying.

11:15.640 --> 11:17.080
Is this how you apologize to someone?

11:17.680 --> 11:19.080
Whoever cares about you is a dog.

11:19.160 --> 11:21.080
-You're indeed a dog.
-You're worse than a dog!

12:15.160 --> 12:16.040
Niaoniao,

12:16.120 --> 12:17.400
how is your sister doing?

12:19.040 --> 12:21.520
Much better.
She fell asleep after taking medicine.

12:22.320 --> 12:24.320
My mom said
Jie used to be like this as a kid

12:24.400 --> 12:25.320
due to poor immunity.

12:27.040 --> 12:28.400
That's a relief.

12:28.480 --> 12:30.920
You should have considered
the consequences of your actions.

12:32.600 --> 12:33.920
Did you make her angry?

12:35.640 --> 12:36.880
I knew it.

12:37.440 --> 12:39.000
I was already angry at you.

12:39.080 --> 12:41.000
If Yan hadn't made me
update you about Jie,

12:41.080 --> 12:42.040
I wouldn't talk to you.

12:42.840 --> 12:43.760
I'm sorry.

12:45.200 --> 12:47.000
I had no idea her condition was that bad.

12:47.600 --> 12:49.280
Jie is moody,

12:49.800 --> 12:51.600
but she usually hides it well.

12:51.680 --> 12:53.160
Yan and I already noticed

12:53.240 --> 12:54.920
that she has been forcing a smile lately.

12:55.720 --> 12:57.960
Ever since her quarrel with Mom
on New Year's Eve,

12:58.040 --> 12:59.360
she has never really recovered.

13:01.080 --> 13:01.920
Forget it.

13:03.000 --> 13:04.800
Maidong, don't blame yourself too much.

13:05.400 --> 13:06.880
She still has me and my brother.

13:07.600 --> 13:10.000
I'll let you know if anything happens.

13:13.200 --> 13:14.040
Thanks, Niaoniao.

13:14.960 --> 13:16.080
You should get back inside.

13:46.040 --> 13:48.280
Why did it take you so long
just to lock the main gate?

13:49.320 --> 13:50.240
You're so slow.

13:53.680 --> 13:54.520
Mom.

13:55.760 --> 13:56.840
We need to talk to you.

14:00.400 --> 14:02.000
Mom, sit down here.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.240
Talk about what?

14:12.800 --> 14:14.480
Talk…

14:14.560 --> 14:15.760
It's already late.

14:16.480 --> 14:17.680
Save it for tomorrow…

14:22.080 --> 14:22.960
Mom,

14:23.480 --> 14:24.920
I'm sure you can see

14:25.000 --> 14:26.200
that Jie has been cranky.

14:27.520 --> 14:29.960
She was asking for it
by dressing scantily in the cold.

14:30.760 --> 14:32.080
That temper of hers--

14:32.160 --> 14:33.800
What's wrong with her temper?

14:33.880 --> 14:36.840
Would she have passed out
if she hadn't been bottling things up?

14:38.640 --> 14:40.040
I wonder who made her so angry.

14:41.000 --> 14:43.280
She and Chen Maidong were madly in love.

14:43.360 --> 14:45.920
Would they have ended up like this
if no one interfered?

14:49.920 --> 14:50.760
Mom,

14:51.400 --> 14:53.600
Jie is the most obedient in our family.

14:54.560 --> 14:58.240
Since she was young,
she has never disobeyed you.

14:59.280 --> 15:00.480
You might not know this,

15:01.000 --> 15:02.680
but she always reminded us in secret

15:03.880 --> 15:06.000
that although you sometimes
don't speak to us nicely,

15:06.520 --> 15:08.360
you're still the most understanding one.

15:09.040 --> 15:10.720
That's why we should listen to you.

15:11.400 --> 15:14.160
When you say there is a river ahead,
we wade across it.

15:14.240 --> 15:16.280
When you say there is a ditch ahead,
we go around it.

15:16.880 --> 15:18.320
Because most of the time,

15:18.880 --> 15:20.040
our parents are right.

15:20.680 --> 15:22.000
We can never

15:22.080 --> 15:25.080
have the same amount of experience
and intuition as you.

15:27.400 --> 15:28.560
But Mom,

15:30.640 --> 15:33.760
you can't keep us safe from harm
our entire lives, right?

15:34.400 --> 15:36.880
Even when there's a net or a pit ahead,

15:36.960 --> 15:38.600
if Jie insists on continuing that path,

15:38.680 --> 15:39.920
just let her be.

15:42.000 --> 15:43.840
She's rarely so insistent on something.

16:38.040 --> 16:39.160
What are you looking at?

16:40.520 --> 16:42.880
Are you happy now that it's my turn
to be lectured by them?

16:46.480 --> 16:48.160
I won't interfere from now on.

16:48.240 --> 16:50.080
The kids will figure it out.

16:52.120 --> 16:53.680
But here's the thing.

16:53.760 --> 16:55.240
When we meet again in the future,

16:56.840 --> 16:58.280
don't you dare say

16:58.920 --> 17:00.160
that I didn't do my duty.

17:17.200 --> 17:19.359
For a second,
I thought you were spraying pesticides.

17:19.440 --> 17:21.000
That would make me sick eventually.

17:21.560 --> 17:23.720
You are the largest vermin in our family.

17:23.800 --> 17:26.400
I'll disinfect thoroughly
to protect your siblings.

17:26.480 --> 17:27.720
Aren't you afraid?

17:27.800 --> 17:29.120
I am your mother.

17:29.200 --> 17:31.120
The virus should be in awe of me.

17:36.240 --> 17:37.160
Let me check.

17:44.480 --> 17:45.520
The fever is gone.

17:45.600 --> 17:46.520
I'm fine.

17:46.600 --> 17:47.680
I'll be better soon.

17:47.760 --> 17:48.680
I'm not that delicate.

17:51.760 --> 17:52.600
Here.

17:53.280 --> 17:55.320
Can this medicinal patch Xixia sent you

17:55.400 --> 17:56.720
really alleviate nerve pain?

17:57.280 --> 17:58.800
It won't treat it completely,

17:58.880 --> 18:00.560
but it's incredibly effective for me.

18:03.000 --> 18:04.440
I've told you.

18:04.520 --> 18:07.160
People who care about your leg
are worth befriending.

18:07.720 --> 18:11.440
Did that person give you
the previous medicinal patches?

18:13.200 --> 18:14.040
Who?

18:17.440 --> 18:18.880
Chen Maidong.

18:18.960 --> 18:20.520
Why can't you say his name?

18:21.120 --> 18:22.440
Does it hurt to say his name?

18:22.520 --> 18:23.600
It's none of your business.

18:37.800 --> 18:39.120
It's awkward for both of us.

18:40.520 --> 18:41.520
That's because

18:42.440 --> 18:44.920
I've never talked to you
about my boyfriends.

18:51.400 --> 18:52.280
Probably.

18:54.320 --> 18:55.720
My first reaction is

18:55.800 --> 18:56.880
no one deserves you.

18:57.400 --> 19:00.080
No guy should dream
about stealing my daughter.

19:02.240 --> 19:03.160
I understand.

19:06.600 --> 19:08.520
So tell me.

19:08.600 --> 19:09.600
What is the difference

19:09.680 --> 19:13.200
between Chen Maidong and the arrogant one?

19:15.640 --> 19:18.880
My love for Ji Tong was one-sided.

19:19.680 --> 19:20.960
With Chen Maidong,

19:22.280 --> 19:23.440
it's real love.

19:23.520 --> 19:25.520
Enough. I can't listen anymore.

19:25.600 --> 19:27.520
What is that? You disgust me.

19:27.600 --> 19:29.920
How is that disgusting?
Have you never been a young girl?

19:30.000 --> 19:31.200
I've never felt what you feel.

19:31.280 --> 19:32.400
I don't get it.

19:32.480 --> 19:34.280
Look at my goosebumps.

19:34.360 --> 19:36.000
Nonsense.

19:39.760 --> 19:42.640
We must deal with reality

19:42.720 --> 19:44.440
regardless of the kind of love.

19:45.200 --> 19:46.400
Then face it.

19:47.520 --> 19:50.440
I couldn't accept
how you take it one day at a time.

19:50.520 --> 19:52.560
If both of you are sincere,

19:52.640 --> 19:54.080
then plan it out.

19:54.160 --> 19:56.760
There are many couples
in a long-distance relationship.

19:56.840 --> 20:00.520
Why can't you figure it out?

20:00.600 --> 20:02.960
It's not about what I want now.

20:03.960 --> 20:05.440
He is ignoring me.

20:06.000 --> 20:07.440
Is he acting arrogant now?

20:09.080 --> 20:11.880
Madam Wu said
the ratio of eligible men to women

20:11.960 --> 20:14.040
in nearby towns is eight to one.

20:14.120 --> 20:15.880
There are plenty of available men

20:15.960 --> 20:17.080
but not many women.

20:17.640 --> 20:20.000
Even the ugly ones can get married.

20:21.640 --> 20:22.840
I'll go talk to him later.

20:22.920 --> 20:24.680
Don't do that. You might scare him.

20:25.400 --> 20:27.720
Besides, love cannot be forced.

20:27.800 --> 20:29.320
I'll try my best.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.040
Just wait.

20:31.120 --> 20:33.000
I'll see how long he can keep it up.

21:50.000 --> 21:51.560
GREAT MAN

21:51.640 --> 21:53.680
ARE YOU FEELING BETTER?

21:55.240 --> 21:56.400
I'M IN BAD SHAPE.

21:56.480 --> 21:59.200
I'M SUFFERING. NOBODY CARES.

21:59.280 --> 22:01.840
I'M OUTSIDE YOUR HOUSE.

22:32.040 --> 22:32.960
You…

22:34.000 --> 22:35.200
What are you doing?

22:35.280 --> 22:37.160
I was looking for you.

22:40.000 --> 22:42.160
What are you wearing? Where's your jacket?

22:43.280 --> 22:44.440
I couldn't wait to see you.

22:49.240 --> 22:50.560
Do you want to die from illness?

22:52.000 --> 22:54.200
Sorry, I'm ugly and smelly.

22:55.680 --> 22:56.560
I don't think so.

22:57.560 --> 22:59.240
You are just a good liar.

22:59.320 --> 23:00.600
You were so active.

23:04.320 --> 23:06.560
Did you really think I was so sick

23:06.640 --> 23:08.040
that I was bedridden?

23:09.000 --> 23:10.560
Anyway, you are too conceited.

23:10.640 --> 23:12.440
You always make people
play into your hands.

23:15.280 --> 23:16.720
That's because you care about me.

23:18.200 --> 23:20.520
That's so corny. I can't take it.

23:22.560 --> 23:24.000
I'm glad that you are fine.

23:24.080 --> 23:25.000
I'm leaving, then.

23:25.800 --> 23:27.360
Okay, go on.

23:29.400 --> 23:32.520
You are letting me go easily this time.

23:46.560 --> 23:48.240
Although I want to kiss you,

23:48.840 --> 23:50.840
I'm afraid I might infect you.

23:52.160 --> 23:53.440
Whatever.

23:54.160 --> 23:55.280
You can owe me a big one.

23:55.360 --> 23:57.480
Nonsense. Being sick is torture.

23:57.560 --> 23:58.960
I can't bear to see you suffer.

24:00.640 --> 24:01.880
Enough with the sweet talk.

24:03.600 --> 24:04.680
I'll give you a chance

24:05.720 --> 24:06.720
to give me an explanation.

24:12.640 --> 24:13.560
Chen Maidong,

24:15.240 --> 24:16.720
I sincerely apologize to you.

24:17.960 --> 24:19.520
That day,

24:20.600 --> 24:22.200
I ran my mouth because…

24:24.480 --> 24:26.600
I'm afraid of removing my prosthetic

24:27.200 --> 24:28.240
in front of any man.

24:29.480 --> 24:30.360
I was scared.

24:31.320 --> 24:32.240
Sorry.

24:49.360 --> 24:50.360
I understand.

24:51.800 --> 24:52.720
I forgive you.

24:58.520 --> 24:59.440
Go back inside.

25:00.640 --> 25:01.760
When you've recovered,

25:02.320 --> 25:03.320
we'll go on another date.

25:08.640 --> 25:09.720
Stay for a while longer.

25:18.280 --> 25:21.440
In the vast galaxies
and among so many people,

25:21.520 --> 25:24.160
meeting one another
and falling in love is a wonder.

25:24.240 --> 25:26.800
Why is God so good at creating people?

25:26.880 --> 25:29.840
He gave humans joy, rage,
worry, love, lust, and hatred.

25:30.800 --> 25:32.160
He let us experience extreme sorrow

25:32.240 --> 25:34.960
but also extreme happiness.

25:38.880 --> 25:39.880
POST

25:49.360 --> 25:51.760
I TICKLED GREAT MAN

25:55.440 --> 25:56.880
CHECK OUT MY MOMENTS!

26:07.600 --> 26:08.720
LA DILETTANTE TICKLED YOU

26:08.800 --> 26:09.640
CHECK OUT MY MOMENTS!

26:12.640 --> 26:14.480
IN THE VAST GALAXIES
AND AMONG SO MANY PEOPLE,

26:14.560 --> 26:16.560
MEETING ONE ANOTHER
AND FALLING IN LOVE IS A WONDER

26:21.720 --> 26:23.400
LIKE

26:29.440 --> 26:30.760
1 NEW NOTIFICATION

26:30.840 --> 26:32.360
GREAT MAN LIKED YOUR POST

26:53.280 --> 26:54.480
I'm so tired.

26:55.160 --> 26:56.160
Has Mom gone mad?

26:56.240 --> 26:57.320
It's only 6 a.m.

26:58.040 --> 27:00.360
I wonder if she's getting revenge.

27:00.440 --> 27:02.000
Don't talk behind someone's back.

27:02.520 --> 27:04.440
I don't do petty things like that.

27:04.520 --> 27:05.640
I'm so sleepy.

27:17.080 --> 27:17.960
Here it comes.

27:24.040 --> 27:25.120
Don't worry.

27:25.200 --> 27:26.640
No broken eggs. No burnt porridge.

27:26.720 --> 27:28.240
The sides are my signature dishes.

27:28.320 --> 27:29.440
Dig in.

27:29.520 --> 27:31.160
Jie, have you recovered?

27:31.880 --> 27:33.080
I've completely recovered.

27:33.160 --> 27:35.320
I felt refreshed
when I woke up this morning.

27:35.400 --> 27:36.600
I was itching to do something.

27:37.600 --> 27:40.280
Jie, you are the only one
who has had enough sleep.

27:40.360 --> 27:41.560
Go back to sleep after you eat.

27:41.640 --> 27:43.400
I'll do all the work today.

27:44.000 --> 27:45.760
All of you have suffered while I was sick.

27:48.440 --> 27:50.160
Mom, why is your face so swollen?

27:50.240 --> 27:51.440
Did you not sleep well?

27:51.520 --> 27:52.800
None of us could sleep well.

27:52.880 --> 27:54.120
Last night, in the yard,

27:54.200 --> 27:56.360
there were two rats squeaking all night.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.960
Fearing the male rat might sneak in,

27:58.040 --> 27:59.680
I searched the house for rat poison.

28:02.720 --> 28:04.600
If you hear any rats from now on,

28:05.120 --> 28:06.200
just continue sleeping.

28:06.280 --> 28:08.320
Cats and rats go their separate ways.

28:08.400 --> 28:10.240
They won't come inside the house
no matter what.

28:20.360 --> 28:22.360
Cut it out! You kicked me.

28:40.200 --> 28:43.040
LIAOGEN BRAISED CHICKEN

28:43.720 --> 28:44.920
Just a moment.

28:47.400 --> 28:48.480
What would you like?

28:50.440 --> 28:51.440
Are you not working today?

28:53.080 --> 28:53.920
Why are you alone?

28:54.000 --> 28:55.720
Where are your siblings?

28:55.800 --> 28:56.880
They are sleeping.

28:56.960 --> 29:00.360
Apparently, two noisy rats outside
kept them up last night.

29:01.560 --> 29:02.800
Your whole family has keen ears.

29:02.880 --> 29:04.400
You are right.

29:04.480 --> 29:06.120
It's tough being a rat lately.

29:07.080 --> 29:09.760
Stop standing here.
You are keeping business away.

29:12.440 --> 29:13.600
Is your mom not around either?

29:13.680 --> 29:15.000
I'm letting her take a break.

29:15.080 --> 29:16.760
She is probably cleaning the house.

29:20.840 --> 29:22.760
Go inside. I'll manage the stall for you.

29:23.480 --> 29:24.560
Can you do it?

29:25.640 --> 29:27.240
Am I worse than your two rats at home?

29:27.320 --> 29:28.640
Don't underestimate them.

29:28.720 --> 29:30.720
One of them is pretty.
The other has a loud voice.

29:31.480 --> 29:32.480
Sorry,

29:32.560 --> 29:33.560
I have both.

29:34.240 --> 29:35.400
Go in. It's cold out here.

29:45.400 --> 29:47.120
Wait. What is this?

30:10.800 --> 30:11.680
Zhuang Jie,

30:12.480 --> 30:13.520
let's go on another date.

30:14.800 --> 30:17.120
A proper and grand date.

30:18.240 --> 30:19.160
Sure.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.680
This time, it will be successful.

30:37.000 --> 30:39.080
In recent days,
the cold front has continued southward.

30:39.160 --> 30:40.680
Cold weather warnings have been issued.

30:40.760 --> 30:42.400
Temperatures in many areas are plummeting.

30:42.480 --> 30:45.360
Our area will experience a flash freeze
that hasn't been seen for decades.

30:45.440 --> 30:48.240
Experts say that low temperatures
will persist for a week

30:48.320 --> 30:49.520
with cold and wet conditions.

30:49.600 --> 30:51.640
The public is advised
to keep warm when going out.

31:08.200 --> 31:10.040
How do you make this
taste 10,000 times better

31:10.120 --> 31:12.280
with the same ingredients?

31:12.360 --> 31:14.280
It's our first proper date after all.

31:14.360 --> 31:15.960
I must use some of my special skills.

31:17.040 --> 31:17.960
Teach me.

31:18.520 --> 31:20.760
No need. I'll make it for you if you want.

31:22.280 --> 31:24.680
Chen Maidong, you are good at scheming.

31:24.760 --> 31:26.640
You use this method so I can't leave you.

31:27.320 --> 31:28.360
What's wrong with that?

31:28.960 --> 31:30.440
Everything needs to be managed.

31:30.520 --> 31:32.320
I scheme so that you know that.

31:34.320 --> 31:35.960
I overestimated you previously.

31:36.520 --> 31:39.600
I thought you were the type
to contribute silently.

31:41.880 --> 31:43.360
That's a fool.

31:44.680 --> 31:47.440
From now on, I will tell you
about everything I do for you.

31:47.520 --> 31:48.800
I'll exaggerate everything.

31:49.560 --> 31:50.720
Otherwise, an ingrate like you

31:51.680 --> 31:53.200
won't remember anything in the future.

31:54.840 --> 31:55.760
I agree.

31:56.800 --> 31:58.960
I completely agree with this point.

31:59.840 --> 32:01.640
When I was young, I was so touched

32:01.720 --> 32:03.520
after reading
Letter from an Unknown Woman.

32:04.360 --> 32:05.960
However, I knew I couldn't do it.

32:07.560 --> 32:10.040
Sacrificing your whole life for love
is too stupid.

32:11.880 --> 32:14.680
Only after learning to love oneself

32:15.520 --> 32:17.720
can one truly understand
how to love others.

32:19.320 --> 32:22.320
Moreover, even family ties
bound by blood are unreliable.

32:23.280 --> 32:24.880
Taking a gamble on love with your life

32:26.600 --> 32:28.160
is a burden for both people.

32:37.880 --> 32:38.960
Both of us

32:40.040 --> 32:41.000
are so tacky.

32:42.720 --> 32:44.640
Modern people are smart.

32:44.720 --> 32:46.040
They are usually calculative.

32:47.360 --> 32:48.360
It's not good either.

32:48.960 --> 32:50.200
It makes love seem

32:50.280 --> 32:51.400
to be not worth mentioning.

32:53.160 --> 32:54.560
True love

32:55.240 --> 32:57.560
won't depreciate no matter what.

32:59.760 --> 33:03.800
Lovers, friends, and beloveds

33:03.880 --> 33:05.520
are just names.

33:06.720 --> 33:08.760
The term I like most is "sweetheart."

33:09.680 --> 33:12.560
"Sweetheart" is used in Western countries.

33:19.160 --> 33:20.960
The brain is not required in love.

33:22.160 --> 33:23.520
You just need your heart.

33:25.320 --> 33:26.680
You salespeople

33:28.000 --> 33:29.440
certainly are good at talking.

33:44.880 --> 33:45.840
Come here.

33:47.280 --> 33:48.120
I don't dare.

33:48.200 --> 33:49.400
Why?

33:50.560 --> 33:51.480
I'm traumatized.

33:54.200 --> 33:55.360
Cut out the nonsense.

33:55.440 --> 33:56.800
Are you coming or not?

33:57.480 --> 33:59.080
No. What will you do about it?

34:00.040 --> 34:01.360
You won't come here, right?

34:03.040 --> 34:04.160
I'll go to you.

34:17.679 --> 34:19.760
I'll say this first.

34:19.840 --> 34:21.080
No matter what you do tonight,

34:21.159 --> 34:22.440
I won't fall for it again.

34:24.040 --> 34:25.040
Fine.

34:25.120 --> 34:27.760
Let me think about what I can do.

34:29.800 --> 34:31.280
You had better behave.

34:31.360 --> 34:33.960
If you do it again,
you'll really mess me up.

34:45.120 --> 34:46.199
Zhuang Jie.

34:46.280 --> 34:47.120
What?

34:51.600 --> 34:52.480
It's snowing.

34:58.040 --> 34:59.000
It's true.

35:00.240 --> 35:01.600
It's actually snowing.

36:33.120 --> 36:35.560
The snow makes the roads slippery.
I dare not drive you home.

36:36.360 --> 36:37.640
Take a bath and sleep here.

36:37.720 --> 36:39.960
If you need anything,
I'll bring it to you in the morning.

36:47.680 --> 36:49.080
Did you make this yourself?

36:52.760 --> 36:53.720
I had free time.

36:58.800 --> 36:59.960
You are lying.

37:04.960 --> 37:05.800
I'm leaving.

37:36.080 --> 37:36.960
Zhuang Jie,

37:38.920 --> 37:40.000
you are not ready.

37:41.040 --> 37:41.960
I can wait.

39:08.800 --> 39:09.640
What?

39:10.360 --> 39:11.480
Are you missing me so soon?

39:18.600 --> 39:19.440
Chen Maidong,

39:21.240 --> 39:23.120
I'm really not a frivolous person.

39:25.600 --> 39:26.440
I know.

39:28.320 --> 39:29.600
When I was in high school,

39:31.040 --> 39:33.080
a matchmaker came to my house.

39:34.800 --> 39:38.000
The guy had polio, but he was kind.

39:38.960 --> 39:40.760
The matchmaker
urged my mom to be realistic.

39:40.840 --> 39:42.880
She said a girl like me

39:42.960 --> 39:44.520
shouldn't study too much.

39:44.600 --> 39:46.640
Learning a life skill
and living a normal life

39:46.720 --> 39:47.960
was better than anything else.

39:49.600 --> 39:52.440
I was almost persuaded back then.

39:54.840 --> 39:56.440
However, my mom told off the matchmaker

39:57.480 --> 40:00.440
and told me studying was the only thing

40:01.000 --> 40:02.640
that could change my fate.

40:05.200 --> 40:06.400
It's as if

40:07.440 --> 40:09.200
everyone reached a consensus

40:09.280 --> 40:10.880
that a girl like me

40:11.520 --> 40:13.520
should be with someone
who is also disabled.

40:14.600 --> 40:15.840
That's the reality.

40:17.840 --> 40:20.640
However, my mom taught me
to teach reality a lesson.

40:22.560 --> 40:24.040
If I am excellent enough,

40:24.600 --> 40:26.240
my disability is no longer a problem.

40:27.880 --> 40:30.240
So I live life to the fullest
more than anyone else.

40:30.920 --> 40:33.480
I want to take control of everything.

40:34.200 --> 40:35.600
I want to choose someone

40:35.680 --> 40:37.560
instead of letting someone else choose me.

40:38.080 --> 40:39.480
I thought I had done it.

40:42.040 --> 40:43.720
Then I went to university

40:44.480 --> 40:45.840
and had a boyfriend.

40:45.920 --> 40:47.520
He was good in all aspects.

40:49.600 --> 40:50.440
However,

40:56.120 --> 40:58.520
when we were about
to be intimate for the first time,

40:59.720 --> 41:01.040
he was obviously shocked

41:03.040 --> 41:04.760
by my leg.

41:06.760 --> 41:09.000
When I had the amputation surgery,

41:11.040 --> 41:12.280
my family was poor.

41:13.760 --> 41:16.040
I was discharged
before my wounds were healed.

41:17.360 --> 41:18.920
The socket didn't fit well.

41:19.680 --> 41:20.880
My wound got infected.

41:20.960 --> 41:22.560
I had a high fever and almost died.

41:23.240 --> 41:24.320
So

41:25.080 --> 41:27.200
the stump looks hideous.

41:30.960 --> 41:32.280
Ever since that day,

41:33.040 --> 41:35.720
I haven't shown anyone my prosthetic.

41:39.200 --> 41:40.440
So Chen Maidong,

41:42.440 --> 41:44.960
I was only posturing in front of you.

41:49.120 --> 41:52.720
I've never been intimate with anyone.

42:01.160 --> 42:02.440
It's nothing humiliating.

42:05.160 --> 42:06.840
After I started my current career,

42:08.480 --> 42:09.920
I haven't gotten close to anyone.

42:14.320 --> 42:15.400
Zhuang Jie,

42:16.360 --> 42:17.320
I've thought it through.

42:19.320 --> 42:21.880
Friends, lovers,

42:21.960 --> 42:23.080
or sweethearts,

42:24.560 --> 42:25.640
anything is fine by me.

42:27.080 --> 42:28.320
As long as we can be together,

42:29.760 --> 42:31.080
I don't care how long it lasts.

42:33.080 --> 42:34.200
Because it's you,

42:35.960 --> 42:36.920
I can do it.

42:42.080 --> 42:43.160
Chen Maidong,

42:46.400 --> 42:47.320
do you want

42:50.400 --> 42:51.680
to come back?

45:37.760 --> 45:44.520
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
